        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree 701bb6d22e398999bce6bbe6298c41304b690a45\nparent 0e8f70a86314bc73539b110d947c41d40c4886fc\nauthor Turtlecute33 <95269376+Turtlecute33@users.noreply.github.com> 1795641805 +0100\ncommitter Turtlecute33 <95269376+Turtlecute33@users.noreply.github.com> 1795728176 +0100\n\nwallet: fail importdescriptors when shutdown interrupts rescan\n\nA rescan that shutdown cut short counted as complete. importdescriptors\nreturned success for descriptors whose history was not scanned, and\nthe wallet did not rescan on the next start.\n\nReport the interrupted scan from ScanFromTime and fail the import with\nthe \"Rescan aborted by user.\" error, as for abortrescan.\n",
